\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Jesus Christ our only Master
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 You alone, my only hope.
\par You have always been my Saviour;
\par I do not know no other one.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par No person born in universe,
\par or an angel of the Lord God
\par can deliver me from the dead,
\par You alone, only you alone
\par \pard\li135\sl190\slmult0  You are my hope.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. My sins are many and heavy,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 and it gives me much sorrow;
\par due to this, Jesus, forgive me,
\par for the sake of your death for me.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Gracefully present me to your
\par Father that you've paid all my price,
\par So that after my sinful act
\par I may be saved from all my sins
\par as you promised.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.    My faith in you O, Lord, I plead,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 let it be so strong in me
\par and your tenderness and mercies
\par be steadfast in me always.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Let me truly love you my Lord,
\par and to also love my brother
\par and in the last day of my life
\par He will strengthen and redeem me
\par from sin and death.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Glory be to God the most high,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 He, the most true and purest,
\par and His only begotten Son
\par Who always stands behind us
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par and unto the Holy Spirit
\par that fights for us all in our lives
\par that we may be pleased in thy sight
\par in this our time to the future in His glory.\f1 
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

